      tests/fm-task-delivery.test.sh
These cover the new launcher, generated ship instructions, and scout promotion.
PASS: canonical bin/fm-lint.sh with pinned ShellCheck 0.11.0.
PASS: bin/fm-doc-audience-check.sh; bin/fm-test-run.sh --check-coverage;
      git diff --check; stock Bash parsing of the changed launcher and library.
The independent reviewer ran four review lenses, 48 fake-runtime launches,
and six deliberate mutations. Five mutations were caught; duplicate execution
survived. Fake launch overhead had a median of 66-71 milliseconds.
NOT RUN: full suite, Herdr checks, pipeline, remote CI, push, PR, or merge.
The task explicitly authorizes targeted checks and local committed delivery.
The first real review launch completed successfully through the new launcher.

